  <data name="space_colour_blue" xml:space="preserve"><value>Blue</value><comment>Name of a colour a Space can have: read by a screen reader for its swatch, and shown beside the heading when it is chosen.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_colour_green" xml:space="preserve"><value>Green</value><comment>Name of a colour a Space can have: read by a screen reader for its swatch, and shown beside the heading when it is chosen.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_colour_grey" xml:space="preserve"><value>Grey</value><comment>Name of a colour a Space can have: read by a screen reader for its swatch, and shown beside the heading when it is chosen.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_colour_orange" xml:space="preserve"><value>Orange</value><comment>Name of a colour a Space can have: read by a screen reader for its swatch, and shown beside the heading when it is chosen.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_colour_pink" xml:space="preserve"><value>Pink</value><comment>Name of a colour a Space can have: read by a screen reader for its swatch, and shown beside the heading when it is chosen.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_colour_purple" xml:space="preserve"><value>Purple</value><comment>Name of a colour a Space can have: read by a screen reader for its swatch, and shown beside the heading when it is chosen.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_colour_red" xml:space="preserve"><value>Red</value><comment>Name of a colour a Space can have: read by a screen reader for its swatch, and shown beside the heading when it is chosen.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_colour_teal" xml:space="preserve"><value>Teal</value><comment>Name of a colour a Space can have: read by a screen reader for its swatch, and shown beside the heading when it is chosen.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_colour_yellow" xml:space="preserve"><value>Yellow</value><comment>Name of a colour a Space can have: read by a screen reader for its swatch, and shown beside the heading when it is chosen.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_home" xml:space="preserve"><value>Home</value><comment>Name shown for the Space the app made itself, until the person gives it a name. A Space is a set of tabs kept apart from the others, such as home and work.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_new_back" xml:space="preserve"><value>Back</value><comment>Button on the page that makes a Space: back to the list of Spaces, with nothing made.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_new_logins" xml:space="preserve"><value>Logins</value><comment>Heading over the choice of whose logins a new Space has: its own, or another Space&apos;s.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_new_make" xml:space="preserve"><value>Make Space</value><comment>Button that makes the new Space and shows it in the window.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_new_name" xml:space="preserve"><value>Name</value><comment>Label of the field for a new Space&apos;s name.</comment></data>
