  <data name="space_new_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>New Space</value><comment>Heading of the page that makes a Space.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_no_colour" xml:space="preserve"><value>None</value><comment>The choice of no colour for a Space or a Group, beside the colours.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_rename_save" xml:space="preserve"><value>Save</value><comment>Button that gives the Space the name in the field.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_rename_title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Edit Space</value><comment>Heading of the page that gives a Space another name or colour.</comment></data>
  <data name="space_tidy" xml:space="preserve"><value>Tidy tabs away</value><comment>Heading over the choices of when a Space&apos;s tabs are tidied away, on the page that edits a Space.</comment></data>
